{"nodes": [{"id": "app_templates_accounts_index_accounts_page", "label": "Accounts Page", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/templates/accounts/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lists connected PlatformAccounts with status badge, truncated last_error and token expiry, and offers Test / Connect-Reconnect / Enable-Disable / Disconnect-Delete. Every mutating action is a POST form carrying action_form.hidden_tag() for CSRF, and destructive ones carry data-confirm. Disconnect (drop tokens) is offered while connected and Delete (drop the record) only when not, so tokens are always cleared before a record can vanish. Tokens themselves are never rendered."}, {"id": "app_templates_accounts_index_redirect_uri_display", "label": "Redirect URI Display Panel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/templates/accounts/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Platform integrations card prints each adapter's exact redirect_uri as copyable code alongside its configured/hint health state, precisely because a character-level mismatch is by far the most common reason a connection fails - it removes the need for the operator to reconstruct the URI from PUBLIC_BASE_URL by hand. It also surfaces the adapter's supports_trends / supports_revenue capability flags."}], "edges": [{"source": "app_templates_accounts_index_accounts_page", "target": "app_templates_base_base_layout", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/templates/accounts/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_templates_accounts_index_accounts_page", "target": "app_templates_accounts_form_connect_account_form", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "app/templates/accounts/index.html"